type: software
title: "Retrieval Source Composition in Automated Web Application Test Generation"
abstract: >-
  Experiment harness and replication package for an empirical study of which
  retrieval sources (requirements, DOM snapshots, historical tests) help a
  local LLM (Llama 3 8B via Ollama) generate more valid Playwright test scripts
  for a web application. The package contains the pipeline scripts (DOM
  capture, indexing, retrieval-augmented generation, static validation,
  execution, selector probing, repair, statistical analysis), the scenarios,
  the knowledge base, the generated scripts, and the raw and recomputed
  results for seven conditions (B0, B1, B2, P, P_no_req, P_no_hist, P_no_dom).
